OL,3,GNEWSATypewriter art exhibition honours
OL,4,Aliterary legends
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art exhibition of famous authors is
OL,7,Fbeing displayed in a library, with one
OL,8,Ftwist - the pictures were all drawn
OL,9,Fentirely with a typewriter.
OL,11,FJames Cook was a teenager and studying
OL,12,Fto be an architect when he stumbled
OL,13,Facross the niche hobby of creating art
OL,14,Fwith a typewriter. Millions of social
OL,15,Fmedia views and some celebrity
OL,16,Fendorsements later, he has made his
OL,17,Fhobby a full-time job.
OL,19,FThe 29-year-old from Braintree, Essex,
OL,20,Fsaid: "All of this happened by mistake.
OL,21,FI was quite happy to do typewriter art
OL,22,Fas a hobby."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
