OL,3,GNEWSATypewriter art exhibition honours
OL,4,Aliterary legends
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis latest exhibition took him three
OL,7,Fyears to complete and pays homage to 50
OL,8,Festeemed authors; particularly fitting
OL,9,Fas many would have used a typewriter.
